; TR-DOS 5.0x system variables for the Xpeccy+ debugger: names given by Xpeccy+
; to the variables described in "Tr-Dos v5.xx variables in Beta 128 Disk
; interface" (Mac Buster^Extreme, 1999-2000). Part of Xpeccy+, MIT license.
;
; @ram <bank>: names of RAM cells in that bank, at the CPU address it
; has at #4000-#7FFF
@ns TRDOS
@ram 5
5CC2 SOS_RET
5CC8 DRIVE_MODES
5CCC CAT_SECTOR
5CCE RW_FLAG
5CCF STACK_COPY
5CD1 AUTO_LINE
5CD4 MOVE_FILE
5CD5 MOVE_SECTOR
5CD6 MOVE_TRACK
5CD7 FILE_PARAM
5CD9 DOS_CH_ADD
5CDB PROG_SIZE
5CDD FILE_NAME
5CE5 FILE_TYPE
5CE6 FILE_START
5CE8 FILE_LENGTH
5CEA FILE_SECTORS
5CEB FILE_SECTOR
5CEC FILE_TRACK
5CF4 CUR_SECTOR
5CF5 CUR_TRACK
5CF6 TEMP_DRIVE
5CFA STEP_RATES
5CFE FDC_COMMAND
5CFF RW_SECTOR
5D00 BUFFER_ADDR
5D02 HL_COPY
5D04 DE_COPY
5D06 FIND_LENGTH
5D07 DELETED_FILES
5D0C BUFFER_FLAG
5D0E COMMAND_MODE
5D0F ERROR_CODE
5D11 COMMAND_LINE
5D13 ERR_SP_COPY
5D16 SYSTEM_REG
5D19 DEFAULT_DRIVE
5D1C SP_COPY
5D1E FOUND_FILE
5D26 DOS_CHANS
